			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ea087741-a95b-5ac1-bf7f-7e02291c077c")
	)
	(text_box "1. Function: D3 lights when the Frontend converter U16 is making VIN_3V3 (J2 pins 68-70), i.e. the Frontend is powered from the cable or from block C. It draws about 1.3 mA from VIN_3V3.\n\n2. Source / changes: Structure designed by Claude (LED with series resistor). R4 1 k 0603 JLC C21190 Basic (31337561 orderable); D3 NCD0805R1 red 0805 JLC C84256 Basic (2848857), https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/C84256.pdf; stock read 25 Nov 2026 10:58 CST. Unverified: LED forward voltage taken as about 2 V from the part class, not measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 553.72 292.1 0)
