		(uuid "ba64bbaa-0b6d-5b37-be71-9eecb65c79fb")
	)
	(text_box "1. Function: J7 and J8 are four-pin ground posts at the top corners for scope-probe and logic-analyser ground leads (each header also has the Frontend ground pins). H1-H4 are M3 holes for stand-offs or rubber feet; they are not connected.\n\n2. Source / changes: Structure designed by Claude. J7/J8 PZ2.54-1X4P-H25, JLC C42431787 (16223 orderable, read 25 Nov 2026 10:58 CST), https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/C42431787.pdf. Holes: KiCad MountingHole_3.2mm_M3 (no part). Unverified: none beyond fit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 690.88 307.34 0)
		(size 112 27.8)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
